Mark schrieb:
> 
> Im an average Nethack player, who with the help of the spoilers, have
> figured out how most things work, but am still unsure of how often /
> how many things you can charge with the PYEC. Is there a limit to the
> number of things you can charge with it?

No, the card has no "charges" of its own; it can re-charge a virtually
unlimited number of times.

> Ive used it to charge
> something once, but now I get the "you feel the PYEC is ignoring you"
> message. Also, if it is just a time delay b/w charges, does invoking
> it when it is not ready to charge increase that delay?

I don't have the source here, but i think the answer is yes. When the
card "ignores you", the sensible thing is _not_ to try again, but
rather to wait for quite a bit longer before you invoke it once more.

